        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-forest-100 dark:bg-forest-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-forest-700 dark:text-forest-300 text-sm font-bold">HT7</div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">HT7 (Shenmen)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Spirit Gate</span></h3>
